{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123203","id":4445635085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCPsCDQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123203","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123203.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123203","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123203/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123203/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123203/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cdb57ec33c6c07b5011274bfaeac7b3fbca3fc22","number":123203,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement constant folding for shader uniforms","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119836\r\n- Addresses #48525?\r\n- Some static checks (array boundry, divide by zero and modulo by zero) can now evaluate constant expressions.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- It largely reuses what's already implemented for `const c = ...` folding, i.e. `_eval_operator()`, but also fixed several bugs down that code path.\r\n- The test project can run indefinitely to fuzz the current implementataion. I tried my best to keep the reference implementation that calculates fold result as close to the GLSL spec as possible.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/48525#issuecomment-834713262\r\nWell, I hope this qualifies \"a system to parse the expression on the CPU side and then calculate an appropriate constant\". The uniform default values computed from expressions are certainly available to the inspector right now.\r\n\r\n## Known limitation\r\n\r\n- GLSL builtin functions are not supported (`sin(), pow()`). They are powerful, but it seems like too big of a project to support all of them at once.\r\n- Constant folding will not work in `.shaderinc` for builtin constants (`PI, TAU, E`). But shaders including such `.shaderinc` will still compile and be able to use those uniforms defined in the include (see include.gdshader in project).\r\n\r\n## AI disclosure\r\nAI is involved in creating the shader generator fuzzer in [this test project](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31922801/119836-uniform-constant-init.zip).\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/la